# Personal data artifacts -- chat.db snapshots, index.db, golden-set
# candidates/entries. These contain real message content and must never
# be committed. See development-plans/PLAN.md's own backup note: only
# attachment_place within index.db is genuinely non-rebuildable; back
# that up separately and outside of git.
/data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
golden*.jsonl
candidates_for_review.jsonl
# Any arbitrary *.jsonl containing real message content -- previously only
# specifically-named golden/candidates paths were covered, so a
# custom --golden/--rejected path outside /data/ wasn't protected.
*.jsonl
